    Say "...... How did you know I have the Pendant of Legend? This is the last little treasure I have."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "What? You think people are earning money by digging-up the ground? You're so shameless as to say you want this precious thing - for nothing! Bloody well go and do something amazing, then I might consider giving it up. Cheek!"

